WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.536
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show"

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:06.939
and the week that everyone wants
to go away.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:10.209
Seriously,
can we just skip this week?

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.378
I mean, no one wants this week.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.081
If 2020 was a week,
this would be it.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.616
We don't want this week.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:19.919
Let's get to the news and jokes.
Well, guys, we're almost there.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.921
We made it to
the night before the election.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.889
Seriously,
I haven't felt this stressed out

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:25.725
since literally every day
since March.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.293
[ Laughter ]
That's right --

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.796
it's election eve,
and everyone is nervous.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.631
President Trump's
gonna spend all night

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.900
waiting for Vladimir Putin
to come down the chimney.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.134
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:36.636
[ Russian accent ] Heh-heh-heh.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:39.772
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:40.906
[ Normal voice ]
Seriously, I feel like

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:42.475
I'm at the very top
of a roller coaster,

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.176
and I know the guy in front
of me is going to throw up.

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:45.611
It's like...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:48.981
"Just brace yourself, man.
Ohh! Come on."

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:50.750
Yup, tomorrow, the only places

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.284
that'll be
more crowded than the polls

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:53.519
are liquor stores.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:55.221
"Three bottles of Tito's?

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.824
Yeah, that should
get me through the night."

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.326
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.328
Here's how tense things are --

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:05.531
earlier today, I walked in on my
stress doll squeezing himself.

00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:08.902
[ Laughter ]
"Someone's in here! Ohhh!"

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.070
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:14.473
"Someone's in here!"

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:16.609
A lot of people are --
across the country

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.678
are really stressed
about tomorrow's election,

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.646
but I saw this commercial
for something that can help.

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:22.048
Check it out.

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:23.916 line:0%
-State of the world
got you down?

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:26.352 line:0%
Want to release the tension
building inside of you?

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:29.555
Take your mind off your problems
with the Fidgey Whatsy!

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.958
The Fidgey Whatsy
is a new stress-relief toy

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.593
here just in time
for the election.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.728
You can spin it.
You can squeeze it.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:37.597
You can spin and squeeze it.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:40.132
Uh, yeah, that's been happening.

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:41.734
We built these
for the amount of stress

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.002
people were having
two months ago,

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:45.271
not off-the-charts numbers
this week.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.840 align:end size:84% position:84%
But don't worry --
that's why we started

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.408
selling them in packs of 20.

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.109
See how many you can break!

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:51.511 line:0%
The Fidgey Whatsy --

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.747 line:0%
for when you need to make
the next two days go fast.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.284
-That's right.
[ Applause ]

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.020
I saw heading into tomorrow
that Trump leads

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:05.391
by 21 points among white voters
without a college degree.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.260
In other words Trump is leading
with any voter

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.161
who attended Trump University.

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:11.463
[ Laughter ]
And this is big.

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:13.799
I saw that Biden leads Trump
among black voters

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:17.269
by a count of 87 to 5.

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:18.671
Hang on -- never mind.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.873
That was actually the score
of yesterday's Chiefs/Jets game.

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:22.141
Never mind.
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:23.843
-Ohh!

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:26.346
-But listen to this --
Trump has apparently told people

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.348
that he's going to declare
victory tomorrow night

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:30.149
if it looks like he's ahead.

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:31.550
Trump said this isn't true.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.252
He's gonna declare victory
if he's ahead or behind.

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:34.787
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:38.257
"It's close in Casper, Wyoming?
Release the balloons."

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:39.992
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:41.460
It's like the guy on
"Man v. Food"

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.395
taking one bite
from a 30-foot burrito

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:44.964
and slapping his name
on the wall.

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.299
"I basically did it, right?
You don't --

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:48.835
You really want to see me
eat the whole -- Come on."

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:51.704
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:52.704
What do you think
is going to happen?

00:02:52.704 --> 00:02:55.642
The "Man v. Food" guy.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.410
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.145
At this point, the only thing
Trump can declare

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:01.447
without anyone questioning him
is bankruptcy.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.415
[ Audience oohs ]
-Mm.

00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:05.018
-Yep. Trump
told confidantes that,

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:06.819
if he's ahead on election night,

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:09.755
he's planning on
just declaring victory early.

00:03:09.755 --> 00:03:11.591
I thought this was pretty
much unheard of,

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.225
but then I was watching
TV last night.

00:03:13.225 --> 00:03:15.327
It turns out it's more common
than you think.

00:03:15.327 --> 00:03:16.796
Check this out.

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:18.797
-Are you an older gentleman?

00:03:18.797 --> 00:03:22.034
Are you running for president
in tightly contested race?

00:03:22.034 --> 00:03:23.903
We know
what you're going through,

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.537
and we know
it might be embarrassing,

00:03:25.537 --> 00:03:27.439
but you're not alone.

00:03:27.439 --> 00:03:29.709
Premature election.

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.144
Because not everyone can raise
their polls.

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:36.282
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:38.751
-Well, after his plan
to declare victory got out,

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:40.186
Trump denied it to reporters,

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:42.989
but check out when he said
about counting ballots.

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:44.924
-I think it's a terrible thing

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:47.460
when ballots can be collected
after an election.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.530
I don't think it's fair
that we have to wait

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.233
a long period of time
after the election.

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:57.036
-So instead of the Biden/Harris
campaign bus,

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.371
Trump supporters will switch
to running mail trucks

00:03:59.371 --> 00:04:00.339
off the road.

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:01.640
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.142
It's always a good time
when your candidate says,

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:06.412
"As long as nobody counts the
ballots, the election is ours."

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:07.880
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.183
But heading into tomorrow,
everybody's eyes on the polls,

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:11.416
especially in swing states.

00:04:11.416 --> 00:04:12.451
Listen to this.

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:14.420 line:0%
-In the critical
battleground states,

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.622 line:0%
a poll from "The New York Times"
and Siena College

00:04:16.622 --> 00:04:20.092 line:0%
shows Biden leading Trump
in four key states --

00:04:20.092 --> 00:04:23.295 line:0%
up by 6 points in Arizona,
3 in Florida,

00:04:23.295 --> 00:04:27.366 line:0%
6 in Pennsylvania,
and 11 points in Wisconsin.

00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:29.235
-At this point,
the best thing Biden can do

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:31.838
to win the election
is to lose his voice.

00:04:31.838 --> 00:04:35.641
"Just don't say anything,
don't do anything, just --

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:37.009
don't put your glasses on
or take them off --

00:04:37.009 --> 00:04:38.744
just don't do anything.

00:04:38.744 --> 00:04:39.912
Get the corn dog away from him.

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:41.848
No corn dog!
No corn dog! No!"

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:43.716
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:46.251
"Don't do it.
Just stay home."

00:04:46.251 --> 00:04:47.954
It's like bringing a kid
into antique store.

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.855
"Don't touch anything.
Just don't touch anything.

00:04:49.855 --> 00:04:52.725
I know it looks like it's --
just don't touch."

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:53.926
Of course, Trump is trying to do

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.327
whatever he can
to turn things around.

00:04:55.327 --> 00:04:57.830
He's been holding rally after
rally across the country.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:58.931 line:0%
Check it out.

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:01.700 line:0%
-14 states between
Saturday and today.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:02.968 line:0%
They are focused
on Pennsylvania.

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:04.870 line:0%
-Trump will spend the entire day
on the road,

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.205 line:0%
holding five rallies,

00:05:06.205 --> 00:05:08.407 line:0%
his final one --
late tonight in Michigan.

00:05:08.407 --> 00:05:12.177 line:0%
That's also where he held
his final rally back in 2016.

00:05:12.177 --> 00:05:14.981
-Yep, he wants everything to be
the same as 2016.

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:16.348
That's why Trump spent
half the rally

00:05:16.348 --> 00:05:18.151
doing the mannequin challenge.

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:22.955
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:24.457
Let's talk about
the Democratic ticket.

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:26.191
Today, Joe Biden
and Kamala Harris

00:05:26.191 --> 00:05:28.660
held their final campaign
events in Pennsylvania,

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.963
where they were joined
by some special guests.

00:05:30.963 --> 00:05:35.001 line:0%
-Joe Biden will be in Pittsburgh
today, accompanied by Lady Gaga.

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:38.270 line:0%
Senator Kamala Harris be over in
Philadelphia with John Legend.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.274 line:0%
The Democrats obviously hoping
that some star power

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:43.876 line:0%
will add some attention
to their campaign.

00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:46.379
-Yeah, Lady Gaga in Pittsburgh
makes sense.

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:47.914
I mean,
her dresses have single-handedly

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:49.982
kept the steel industry
in business.

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:52.684
[ Laughter ]

00:05:52.684 --> 00:05:54.253
Backstage, Biden was like,

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:57.590
"Say, did you ever tour with
a fella named Whistlin' Frank?"

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.959
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:01.494
"Played the spoons."

00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:03.429
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:05.897
Back in Washington, everyone is
on edge about tomorrow.

00:06:05.897 --> 00:06:07.399
And at the White House,
they're beefing up security.

00:06:07.399 --> 00:06:08.534
Look at this.

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:11.270 line:0%
-Less than 24 hours
before the big day,

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.672 line:0%
there is a non-scalable fence

00:06:13.672 --> 00:06:17.209 line:0%
expected to go back up
around the White House today.

00:06:17.209 --> 00:06:18.778
-At this point,
I'm not sure if Trump's trying

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:21.580
to keep protesters out
or keep himself in.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.782
[ Light laughter ]

00:06:22.782 --> 00:06:23.982
Oh, and this is making
a lot of news.

00:06:23.982 --> 00:06:25.418
At a rally last night
in Florida,

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:28.054
the crowd started chanting,
"Fire Fauci!"

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:29.355
And Trump had a very
interesting response.

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:30.423 line:0%
Take a look.

00:06:30.423 --> 00:06:33.759 line:0%
[ Crowd chants "Fire Fauci "]
-Hmm.

00:06:33.759 --> 00:06:38.163 line:0%
[ Chanting continues ]

00:06:38.163 --> 00:06:40.766 line:0%
-Don't tell anybody,
but let me wait till

00:06:40.766 --> 00:06:42.668 line:0%
a little bit
after the election, please.

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:44.870 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.073 line:0%
I appreciate the advice.

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:49.541
-Mm. In a few days, we might be
getting COVID updates

00:06:49.541 --> 00:06:51.477
from Dr. Lil Wayne.

00:06:51.477 --> 00:06:53.479
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:55.514
The campaign has finally drawn
to a close.

00:06:55.514 --> 00:06:58.183
And after hundreds of rallies,
I think this clip best sums up

00:06:58.183 --> 00:06:59.484
Trump's closing argument

00:06:59.484 --> 00:07:02.121
for why he believes
he deserves a second term.

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:04.891
♪♪

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:06.558 line:0%
-If you're Italian,
do you happen to like

00:07:06.558 --> 00:07:09.028 line:0%
Christopher Columbus?

00:07:09.028 --> 00:07:10.763 line:0%
"Chris-to-for." Huh?

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:11.831
-What?!

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:15.267
♪♪

00:07:15.267 --> 00:07:18.838
-How another one of Trump's
strongest closing arguments?

00:07:18.838 --> 00:07:19.839
-Yeah.

00:07:19.839 --> 00:07:22.307
♪♪

00:07:22.307 --> 00:07:24.977 line:0%
-You know why they're trying to
talk everybody out of voting?

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:27.713 line:0%
People aren't buying it, CNN,
you dumb bastards.

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:29.081
[ Laughter ]

00:07:29.081 --> 00:07:30.849
♪♪

00:07:30.849 --> 00:07:34.253
[ Laughter continues ]

00:07:34.253 --> 00:07:35.922
-Well, this is a big story.

00:07:35.922 --> 00:07:38.624
The Biden campaign canceled
an event in Texas

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.726
after a pretty scary incident.
Watch this.

00:07:40.726 --> 00:07:43.262 line:0%
-A caravan
of President Trump supporters

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.264 line:0%
surrounding a Biden/Harris bus.

00:07:45.264 --> 00:07:48.200 line:0%
The vehicles tried
to slow down the bus

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.735 line:0%
and also run it off the road.

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:51.003
-Yeah, great.

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:52.437
That was my biggest complaint
about this year --

00:07:52.437 --> 00:07:54.573
it wasn't quite "Mad Max"
enough.

00:07:54.573 --> 00:07:55.841
[ Laughter ]

00:07:55.841 --> 00:07:57.376
Well, speaking of driving,

00:07:57.376 --> 00:08:00.045
check out what Hertz is doing
to help people vote.

00:08:00.045 --> 00:08:02.615 line:0%
-Hertz, meanwhile, is helping
people get the polls.

00:08:02.615 --> 00:08:05.251 line:0%
Starting today, as part
of its drive to vote program,

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:08.154 line:0%
any customer who rents a car
for two or more days

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:10.856 line:0%
will get a free rental day.

00:08:10.856 --> 00:08:12.591
-Dollar Rental was planning
the same thing,

00:08:12.591 --> 00:08:13.759
but, unfortunately,
all their cars

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:15.895
are "active crime scenes."

00:08:15.895 --> 00:08:18.364
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.232 --> 00:08:21.434
[ Chuckles ]

00:08:21.434 --> 00:08:22.935
[ Laughter ]

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:24.436
Here's some news
from overseas.

00:08:24.436 --> 00:08:27.039
[ Laughs ]

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:29.074
That joke's too real
for a couple of people.

00:08:29.074 --> 00:08:31.276
"Yeah, that's scaring me."
-Yeah, yeah.

00:08:31.276 --> 00:08:33.512
[ Laughter ]
-Here's some news from overseas.

00:08:33.512 --> 00:08:34.780
Just came out
that Prince William

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.848
had the coronavirus
back in the spring.

00:08:36.848 --> 00:08:38.217 line:0%
Listen to this.

00:08:38.217 --> 00:08:41.086 line:0%
-Prince William, second in line
to the British throne,

00:08:41.086 --> 00:08:44.056 line:0%
tested positive
for coronavirus in April,

00:08:44.056 --> 00:08:48.461 line:0%
but, controversially, choosing
to keep his diagnosis a secret.

00:08:48.461 --> 00:08:50.262
-Man, Prince William
must have gone crazy.

00:08:50.262 --> 00:08:53.732
I mean, imagine being cooped up
in just 795 rooms.

00:08:53.732 --> 00:08:56.268
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, man.

00:08:56.268 --> 00:08:59.104
-Here's some news that isn't
about the election or the virus.

00:08:59.104 --> 00:09:02.975
A Canadian man sued Canada Dry
for making false claims.

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:04.109
Let's see how that went.

00:09:04.109 --> 00:09:06.845 line:0%
A B.C. man has won
a class-action lawsuit

00:09:06.845 --> 00:09:09.615 line:0%
against the makers
of Canada Dry Ginger Ale.

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:12.618 line:0%
Victor Cardoso alleged
that the advertising slogan

00:09:12.618 --> 00:09:15.221 line:0%
"Made from Real Ginger"
was misleading

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.155 line:0%
and the product
contained no ginger.

00:09:17.155 --> 00:09:20.859 line:0%
He was awarded $200,000, most
of which will go to legal fees.

00:09:20.859 --> 00:09:23.195
-That's -- That's it.
I'm suing Mountain Dew

00:09:23.195 --> 00:09:25.731
for not being made
from mountains or dew.

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:27.867
[ Laughter ]

00:09:27.867 --> 00:09:30.736
"I thought this was organic!"
[ Laughter ]

00:09:30.736 --> 00:09:32.972
As soon as they heard that,
Dr Pepper started Googling

00:09:32.972 --> 00:09:34.807
"How to quickly get
a medical degree."

00:09:34.807 --> 00:09:36.442
[ Laughter ]

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:38.010
And finally, this is wild --

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.079
a train in the Netherlands
went through a safety barrier

00:09:41.079 --> 00:09:42.714
and almost fell more
than 30 feet,

00:09:42.714 --> 00:09:45.183
but it was saved by
a giant sculpture

00:09:45.183 --> 00:09:47.520
of a whale tail called --

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.854
this is the name
of the sculpture --

00:09:48.854 --> 00:09:51.290
"Saved by the Whale's Tail."
-What?

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.324
-What?
-Look at this photo.

00:09:52.324 --> 00:09:53.758
Look at this thing.

00:09:53.758 --> 00:09:55.327
-Whoa.
-I know it's in Europe,

00:09:55.327 --> 00:09:57.263
but a broken train
